; Import library for the Miles Sound System, generated once from the
; exports of Miles' mss32.dll (the third-party runtime build/all.sh copies
; off the disc). build/engine.sh turns it into mss32.lib with LIB /DEF;
; NOLF.exe and lithtech.exe link it.
;
; The leading underscore is stripped: LIB decorates a .def entry, so
; `AIL_startup@0` here yields the export name `_AIL_startup@0` that the
; DLL really carries and the `__imp__AIL_startup@0` the compiler asks
; for. Leaving the underscore on produces `__imp___AIL_startup@0`.
LIBRARY mss32
EXPORTS
